Collect and explore as many resources as possible, and choose efficient collection methods and skill synergy effects.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Demo Content</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lead a limited number of 6 types of stone golems to build the Giant Stone Tribe.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The research institute provides only 10 new rift spaces to unlock.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each class in the skill tree offers only 2 additional skill options.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only 10 blessings are available in the talent options for free combination.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Silence Moon"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3561030","name":"Rock Island"},"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865710/51102452de4be6fa5ed73c28567c38676796718f/header.jpg?t=1757086709","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257166317,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257166317/movie480.mp4?t=1757086707","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257166317/movie_max.mp4?t=1757086707"},"name":"Gameplay","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257166317/63d4ac1b3869d79d6df9b985ebf17102704deb57/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1757086707","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257166317/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1757086707","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257166317/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1757086707"}}],"name":"Rock Island Demo","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-8100<br